{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>炎明熹近日為宣傳全新音樂作品化身瀟灑失戀女，於海濱一帶拍攝短片大爆愛情金句。她在鏡頭前突然戲癮大發，手持道具當 …</p><p></p>\n<p>炎明熹近日為宣傳全新音樂作品化身瀟灑失戀女，於海濱一帶拍攝短片大爆愛情金句。她在鏡頭前突然戲癮大發，手持道具當街上演一幕霸氣撕毁婚書戲碼。這位樂壇小天后罕見展現出決絕狠心反差面貌，這次破格聯乘企劃為即將發佈新歌埋下極大伏線。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹型格打扮 大爆失戀金句</h2>\n<p>這名新生代女歌手一改平日在公眾面前乖巧伶俐形象，換上型格黑色波點透視長袖上衣及闊身牛仔短褲，手持迷你咪高峰現身海濱拍攝預告片。她在鏡頭前完全放飛自我，擺出極度瀟灑神情大叫「好似韓劇咁！鬼！狂！」，甚至肉緊握拳高呼「決心要放低前度！」。全片最具衝擊力一幕正是她拿出手寫結婚紙道具，對鏡頭一臉認真丟下一句「好彩仲未去簽紙」，隨即毫不猶豫雙手齊上將紙張狠狠撕成兩半。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹夥拍「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」自嘲感情上撞板</h2>\n<p>除了獨自飆戲展現過人演藝細胞，預告片段中更出現另一張網民熟悉面孔，正是「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」李倩同。身穿深藍色針織外套配搭淺藍恤衫現身客串，與一身酷爆造型女主角並肩站在海旁樹蔭下合體大拋笑彈。兩人頭貼頭拿著迷你咪高峰默契十足望向鏡頭，齊齊大聲宣告「感情路上撞咗板！」，以中二幽默手法演繹新世代面對感情挫折灑脫態度。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹李倩同青春滿瀉充滿火花</h2>\n<p>這次宣傳企劃巧妙融合流行音樂與網絡短片元素帶來新鮮感。在另一幕充滿幕後花絮感畫面之中，樂壇小天后開心對著鏡頭舉起V字手勢，身旁拍檔則面帶甜美微笑伸手介紹，整個同框畫面洋溢著滿滿青春活力。兩名不同頻道具潛力新生代女生首次跨界合作充滿火花，雙雙以截然不同活潑形象呈現人前。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949089685368865_10394704636afc232925cf1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6332563574831650208.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949089685368865_10394704636afc232925cf1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490896979437041_15089030866afc232a3e180.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6332563574831650204.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490896979437041_15089030866afc232a3e180.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897067521108_19685252016afc232b10cfa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6332563574831650205.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897067521108_19685252016afc232b10cfa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897144156582_14282709506afc232be1dd6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6332563574831650203.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897144156582_14282709506afc232be1dd6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897237361377_13151127156afc232cc988b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6332563574831650207.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897237361377_13151127156afc232cc988b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/photo_6262396509429551375_y_85783167468e1fcea76981.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"小薯茄 anabelle李倩同 （圖片來源：YouTube@小薯茄）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/photo_6262396509429551375_y_85783167468e1fcea76981.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」李倩同（圖片來源：YouTube@小薯茄）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/175963978806346103_24946791768e1f8ec72b5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"小薯茄 anabelle李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@ana.belle.li）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/175963978806346103_24946791768e1f8ec72b5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ana.belle.li）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b0%8f%e8%96%af%e8%8c%84/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">小薯茄</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e5%80%a9%e5%90%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李倩同</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%82%8e%e6%98%8e%e7%86%b9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">炎明熹</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544803\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:12:50.968851+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1171,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:49:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:06:19.343060+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:06:19.343060+00:00","content_hash":"cf754ae7ce7cb7032934741fe6e83cbd4839dc0554cdeccbaa845b46e7d8f4e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}